# Articles (decision article-optional): `x is a number`, `x is an int` is the type test `x is number`; early sugar, so
# the type tests pass (core/analysis/type_tests.warp) reads the test without its article. A program binding `a` or `an`
# keeps its own `x is a`
rewrite $x is $article $t => $x is $t where $article in [a, an] and $article is unbound
